Worked on:

- some visual glitches here and there;
- edited triggers in the Farm Interior to maybe ensure better trigger of Narrator's lines, but that was caused by different reasons in the end, so I am mentioning this here for no reason really;
- added TicketMaster and OldHag to overall NPC Master Sound group - they were gone rogue upon setup;
- corrected the behavior of new SaveGame slots - now they are changing colours if already used within Main and Pause Menus.

This build got updates in following areas:

- Ending plays! Even more fixes for that bas**** to show up. Now it does;
- Some unneeded ParticleSystems do not show up anymore;
- some triggers modified to shoot only once;
- various corrections within levels regarding placement of some objects [a bit lower, a bit higher, etc.];
- addressed correct turn of Hero [whether he is facing left or right upon load];
- couple lines triggered incorrectly - fixed;
- map updates with missing pieces;
- some Quest progression changed to provide more timely information.

On the way:
- Audio Controls;
- Slight PauseMenu change to better up the UI.

Good day!

Hot from the presses - GRUNND is getting updated with latest fixes. 

- a particular Map piece will not show too fast;
- Ending Titles will show up properly - there were instances Narrator doesn't tell you what happened to each of the characters and Hero himself;
- improved Variables of ending dialogue;
- improved "hotspots" in some occasions to make clicking on them easier [so you don't have to be over-precise with your positioning];
- targetFrameRate upped to 60;
- infinite loop bug should be fixed [but I will continue to monitor reports on this one];
- some small stuff. 

Even if current issues are solved [hopefully], I will still touch up things via couple small updates.

All the best!

The day has come! On Wednesday, June 30th, we are launching our Kickstarter campaign! To celebrate this and to encourage to support GRUNND, the last Update brings these things:

- Controller Support;
- couple audio tweaks;
- changed Establishment Tom's position slightly, to avoid stutter, as the conversation took place near the stairs and sometimes Hero could not decide whether he wants to have a chat or go down the stairs [like in real life];
- fixed the issue with Alternative Destination triggers acting up and NOT going away [just like our Hero in previous point];
- added KickStarter weblink to MainMenu [yes];
- minor Pathfinding tweaks.

Thank you again for you being here! 

If you like GRUNND, do consider helping us over at Kickstarter: [url=https://tinyurl.com/GRUNNDks]Click Here[/url]

